# Platform support impersonation (P2-B)

Read-only operator session for platform ops (`owner` · `admin` · `support`) on **`{club}.admin.{PLATFORM_ROOT_DOMAIN}`** only. Denali workspace package is **not** modified — guards live in API middleware and web operator shell.

## Flow

```text
Super Admin (admin.{root})
  Owner tab → POST /platform/v1/tenants/:id/impersonate
  → audit IMPERSONATE_START
  → { sessionToken, exchangePath: "/auth/platform-impersonate", expiresAt }

Club admin host
  GET /auth/platform-impersonate?token=…
  → POST /api/auth/platform-impersonate (web BFF)
  → POST /auth/accept-platform-impersonation (API verify JWT)
  → Set-Cookie session (Max-Age=1800)
  → redirect /dashboard

Operator shell: data-operator-impersonation-banner
Write routes (PATCH/POST/DELETE with rateLimit): 403 IMPERSONATION_READ_ONLY
```

## API routes

| Method | Path | Auth | Role |
|--------|------|------|------|
| `POST` | `/platform/v1/tenants/{tenantId}/impersonate` | platform ops Bearer + phone | `assertPlatformOpsImpersonateRole` (owner/admin/support) |
| `POST` | `/platform/v1/tenants/{tenantId}/impersonate/end` | same | optional body `{ reason?: "manual" \| "timeout" \| "replaced" }` |
| `POST` | `/auth/accept-platform-impersonation` | none (one-time JWT in body) | verifies impersonation JWT |

### Start response (200)

```json
{
  "sessionToken": "<RS256 JWT>",
  "exchangePath": "/auth/platform-impersonate",
  "expiresAt": "<ISO-8601>"
}
```

JWT claims (30m expiry): `sub`, `tenant_id`, `role: "owner"`, `sess_ver`, `platform_impersonation_readonly: true`, `platform_impersonator` (ops phone).

## Readonly guard

`assertOperatorImpersonationReadonly` runs inside `runWithHttpRequestContext` when `options.rateLimit` is set (write-tier routes). GET/HEAD pass through. Mutations with impersonation JWT → `ImpersonationReadOnlyError` → HTTP **403** `{ "error": "forbidden", "code": "IMPERSONATION_READ_ONLY" }`.

## Audit

| Action | When |
|--------|------|
| `IMPERSONATE_START` | successful start |
| `IMPERSONATE_END` | `POST …/impersonate/end` (operator logout END audit deferred v1.1) |

## Platform billing vs Denali finance

Impersonation and platform billing (P2-C) do not touch `/finance/*` or `packages/workspaces/denali/**`.

